          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 24 2024 19:35:28 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">The Oculan Platform</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Moving the needle forward in surgical lighting</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The Oculan Platform redefines the surgical lighting experience while providing innovative, clinical solutions to common lighting challenges.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Inclusive of two unique surgical lights, the Oculan Platform is built to deliver consistent, bright light to the surgical site while providing differentiated solutions to customer needs.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Leveraging our modular suspension and the addition of our advanced clinical applications Microspot and SHD Mode, this lighting platform is designed to provide a smoother visual experience for clinical staff.</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 23 2026 16:42:22 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
