          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 24 2024 19:35:28 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Enhanced image quality</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Visualize cases with enhanced image quality using the StrykeCam 4K surgical in-light camera. The new 4K HDMI output delivers an improved visual experience with 240× zoom and 700° picture rotation, all while maintaining the same footprint and physical dimensions as the previous generation.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">StrykeCam 4K surgical in-light camera is designed to optimize workflow by enabling light-to-light mobility within the Oculan surgical lighting system.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jun 19 2026 18:19:36 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
