          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Designed for flexibility&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The clinical roll stand, available with the Oculan or Oculan+ light head, gives the platform the mobility needed to deliver a flexible lighting solution. Whether used as a standalone fixture or paired with our Chromophare suspension system, it offers ease of use and enhanced adaptability for your hospital environment. &nbsp;</span></p>\n",
